  Figma-to-React Native Pixel-Perfect Parity System                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
     Overview                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
     Build a comprehensive system that extracts EXACT, deterministic values from Figma's layer structure (not AI interpretation of images), stores them hierarchically, validates implementation against these exact values, and uses dual-model AI (Opus 4.5 + Gemini 3 Pro) for edge      
     case detection.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
     Core Philosophy: Deterministic Extraction Over Visual Interpretation                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
     The Key Insight: Figma stores designs as a structured tree of nodes with exact numeric values for every property. Rather than "looking at" screenshots and guessing, we extract:                                                                                                       
     - Exact hex colors (from fills[].color)                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                
     - Exact font sizes in pixels (from style.fontSize)                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     
     - Exact padding values (from paddingTop/Right/Bottom/Left)                                                                                                                                                                                                                             
     - Exact border radii (from cornerRadius or individual corner values)                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
     - Exact shadow parameters (from effects[])                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
     This makes the conversion deterministic, not probabilistic.                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
