     The Extraction Philosophy                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
     Instead of "looking at" images and guessing values, we:                                                                                                                                                                                                                                
     1. Parse the Figma node tree to get exact numeric values                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
     2. Map values directly to React Native properties                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      
     3. Use AI only for edge cases and validation (not primary extraction)                                                                                                                                                                                                                  
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
