     Phase 7: Code Connect Integration (Bi-directional Mapping)                                                                                                                                                                                                                             
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
     What is Code Connect?                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
     Code Connect creates a persistent link between Figma components and React Native components. Once mapped:                                                                                                                                                                              
     - Figma shows which RN component implements each design                                                                                                                                                                                                                                
     - Changes in Figma can be tracked against code                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         
     - Design drift is detectable                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
     Setting Up Code Connect Mappings                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
